{"id":"1c367ee40265c411","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AxTA.md","title":"AxTA","display":"AxTA","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"AxTA","parameters":["a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"AxTA"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论模型与证明。有序参数：<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ AxTA a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E\n  (exists F\n    (exists R\n      (exists f\n        (exists r\n          (exists D\n            (exists I\n              (exists J\n                (and\n                  (@ ArSig E F R f r)\n                  (and\n                    (@ NatStructure F R D I J)\n                    (and (@ FSentence E F R f r a) (forall e (implies (@ FAssign D e) (@ FSat E F R f r D I J e a))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35d6d56fbb2c8833\" href=\"?note=35d6d56fbb2c8833\" title=\"ZFC_ArSig\">ArSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b1aebb86096a232a\" href=\"?note=b1aebb86096a232a\" title=\"ZFC_FAssign\">FAssign</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c284b26e0e1daa9f\" href=\"?note=c284b26e0e1daa9f\" title=\"ZFC_FSat\">FSat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53c6f94a73ab3e2c\" href=\"?note=53c6f94a73ab3e2c\" title=\"ZFC_FSentence\">FSentence</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"509b31e4f1aec845\" href=\"?note=509b31e4f1aec845\" title=\"ZFC_NatStructure\">NatStructure</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ AxTA a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_ArSig","status":"resolved","id":"35d6d56fbb2c8833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]；[[ZFC_NatStructure|NatStructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FAssign","status":"resolved","id":"b1aebb86096a232a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]；[[ZFC_NatStructure|NatStructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FSat","status":"resolved","id":"c284b26e0e1daa9f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]；[[ZFC_NatStructure|NatStructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FSentence","status":"resolved","id":"53c6f94a73ab3e2c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]；[[ZFC_NatStructure|NatStructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NatStructure","status":"resolved","id":"509b31e4f1aec845","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","exce